// GHIDRA_COMMENT civ0 -> 9920 miner, civ1 -> 9922 prospector, civ2 -> 9924 farmer,
// GHIDRA_COMMENT civ3 -> 9926 forester, civ4 -> 9928 engineer, civ5 -> 9930 rancher,
// GHIDRA_COMMENT civ8 -> 9936 driller.
// GHIDRA_COMMENT_END

